## Model card / alias note

- Google's official model catalog (as of Oct 2026) lists `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` (GA, May 7, 2026, retiring May 7, 2027) and `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview` (real-time audio/live), while the bulk Flash line is represented by `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `gemini-3.6-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, and `gemini-3.8-flash`.
- I could not locate a stable non-Live model whose exact ID is simply `gemini-3.1-flash`; the 3.x Flash releases point to `gemini-3-flash-preview` and the 3.1-specific model is `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`.
- There may be a preview variant or a queue-aggregation artifact, but no vendor docs confirming a distinct `gemini-3.1-flash` family member with benchmarks and pricing.
- No reliable benchmark table was found under the exact slug ID.

